  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Easy Answers**: rare: 9 archived performances [9]\n- **Looks Like Rain**: back after 33 archived shows (676 days) [9]\n- **Happy Birthday Mickey**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [9]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2021-09-11.RiverbendMusicCenterCincyOH** (recommended): audience recording; 22 songs; 186 min; rated 3/5 by 2 [1]\n- **dac2021-09-11.AKGmix.toaste.flac16**: source not stated; 21 songs; 187 min; rated 5/5 by 4 [2]. Said about its sound: Recording captures strong presence despite being taped from a long distance back, with well-chosen microphones [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer says they are from Dayton, about 60 miles up I-75 from Cincinnati [4]\n- Reviewer felt the band played tightly, locked into the groove [6]\n- Reviewer found the crowd unusually quiet and the show sleepy for a Cincinnati night [8]\n- Oteil Burbridge played drums during the drums segment [2]\n- Reviewer considers this possibly the best-sounding Dead and Company recording they have heard [5]\n- Reviewer judged it a snoozer compared with what they expect from a Cincinnati show [8]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2021-09-11.RiverbendMusicCenterCincyOH**: taped by W Zimmerman; transferred by JT/NY; source: Aud > Sennheiser ME80's > GakCables > MixPre 6 @ 16/48 [1]. Also: Edited and tracked in Sound Forge Pro 13, then converted to FLAC with Traders Little Helper [1]\n- **dac2021-09-11.AKGmix.toaste.flac16**: taped by Toaste; transferred by Toaste; source: 3x AKG398 shotguns (L,C,R); 1x AKG394 Figure-8 (L,R); 2x AKG391 cardioids DIN (L,R); 2x AKG392 omnis 5-foot spread (L,R) > Zoom F8 @ 44.1/16... Omnis moved to… [2]. Also: Taped front center lawn about 15 yards back with mics at head level, using AKG shotguns, figure-8, cardioids and omnis into a Zoom F8; Omnis were moved from a five-foot to three-foot spread for the second set; unmixed tracks are also available [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Worthpoint: [Dead And Company Tour Poster 2022 6/22/22 Cincinnati OH Riverbend | #4542504875](https://www.worthpoint.com/worthopedia/dead-company-tour-poster-2022-22-22-4542504875) [10]",
